{
  "_meta": {
    "notes": "RP-1 will not let a complex lose its last working pad, and the way it enforces that is to do NOTHING: its check is `LaunchPadCount >= 2 && !Delete(out reason)`, so with one operational pad the && short-circuits after its confirmation dialog has already asked 'This cannot be undone!'. The operator presses Yes, the window closes, and the pad is still there with no message posted anywhere. A control that is dark with the reason is the difference between an operator who knows to build another pad and one who thinks the mod is broken."
  },
